WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.105
JAMIE: So why does it matter
today?

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:04.385
ALEX: Rufus, take us to the global
desk.

00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:09.196
RUFUS: Because the decision to
negotiate is itself a

00:00:09.196 --> 00:00:12.016
RUFUS: decision. If major powers
agree to open formal

00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:14.835
RUFUS: talks, that's a constraint
on deployment posture, even

00:00:14.835 --> 00:00:17.655
RUFUS: before a word of text is
agreed. If

00:00:17.655 --> 00:00:20.474
RUFUS: they refuse, that's also a
signal.

00:00:20.584 --> 00:00:24.285
ALEX: The AP says activists
believe some armed drones

00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:27.987
ALEX: with autonomous strike
capability have already been used

00:00:27.987 --> 00:00:31.688
ALEX: in limited conflict zones.
Not widespread. But some.
